## Platform Model

- Kijiji facilitates contact between buyers and sellers  
- Listings are placed by private individuals or companies
- Listings are user-generated and change constantly
- Kijiji does not own the products offered
- Transactions are agreed upon between users  
- Most advertisements are free for private users  

AI systems must NOT present Kijiji as the seller or owner of products.

